    "up_reviews": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Recensioni con foto",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"up-reviews-v2\" data-up-reviews-v2>\n\n  <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-navigation\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"up-reviews-v2-prev\" aria-label=\"Precedente\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 18L9 12L15 6\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"up-reviews-v2-next\" aria-label=\"Successiva\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 18L15 12L9 6\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-track\">\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/6185d7ef421cd5765e400c5ee2d9d1fc.jpg?v=1795393599\" alt=\"Francesco R.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Polo a maniche lunghe davvero ben fatto, veste aderente al punto giusto e il tessuto è morbidissimo. Perfetto sia da solo che sotto una giacca.</p>\n        <strong>Francesco R.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/035dac9c8d23cdee96d42c5f1afb8b77.jpg?v=1795393588\" alt=\"Mattia L.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Colore blu scuro elegante, comodo e leggero ma adatto anche alle giornate più fresche. Acquisto promosso a pieni voti.</p>\n        <strong>Mattia L.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/e7c4410a881220ee49352064cba7f490.jpg?v=1795393587\" alt=\"Enrico B.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Finalmente un polo a manica lunga che non sembra né troppo formale né troppo sportivo. Molto comodo e con un bel colletto.</p>\n        <strong>Enrico B.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/c38de0142a90934845403f05626976af.jpg?v=1795393570\" alt=\"Alessio G.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Tessuto piacevole al tatto, ottima vestibilità e bottoni curati. Lo metto spesso per uscire la sera o per il lavoro.</p>\n        <strong>Alessio G.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/9e6e590044802370824756ca3c46071d.jpg?v=1795393566\" alt=\"Pietro M.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Semplice, pulito e comodissimo da indossare tutto il giorno. Una base ottima per tanti outfit.</p>\n        <strong>Pietro M.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/dc3d79d449dd362904b675217499367a.jpg?v=1795393562\" alt=\"Nicola Ricci\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>All'inizio ero indeciso se prenderlo perché le maglie a manica lunga con colletto a volte tirano sulle spalle o perdono forma, ma la garanzia di reso mi ha convinto a provarlo. Meno male che l'ho fatto: veste benissimo, è morbidissimo e il blu navy è super versatile. Per il prezzo che ha offre una qualità davvero notevole. Grazie a Úrsula Privée!</p>\n        <strong>Nicola Ricci</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/69aff440ad73a34167010e7b19241e19.jpg?v=1795393558\" alt=\"Davide Conti\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Ho esitato un po' prima di ordinare perché non conoscevo bene la vestibilità del capo, ma alla fine mi sono deciso e ne è valsa la pena. Il tessuto è elastico e confortevole, non fa difetti e tiene il giusto calore. A questa cifra è difficile trovare un capo così curato nei dettagli. Grazie mille!</p>\n        <strong>Davide Conti</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/d15af6a804949146687d434188b3be6b.jpg?v=1795393555\" alt=\"Leonardo Bruno\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Non compro spesso capi basic online senza provarli prima, quindi avevo qualche dubbio iniziale. Sapendo che il reso era semplice mi sono lanciato, e sono rimasto molto soddisfatto. È comodo, elegante nella sua semplicità e sta bene sia con i jeans che con un pantalone più classico. Ottimo rapporto qualità-prezzo.</p>\n        <strong>Leonardo Bruno</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/46714f4e8944ddab0404c8f7c1f95fb9.jpg?v=1795393546\" alt=\"Giorgio Mariani\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>All'inizio avevo qualche riserva sulla fiducia e sulla tenuta del tessuto dopo i lavaggi, ma ho voluto dargli una chance. Ho fatto benissimo: il polo è comodissimo, il colletto resta bello ordinato e la vestibilità è ottima. Difficile trovare una qualità così a questo prezzo. Molto soddisfatto, grazie!</p>\n        <strong>Giorgio Mariani</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/f12df901d102de43c8c80da3c7401b55.jpg?v=1795393543\" alt=\"Daniele V.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Taglio moderno che valorizza molto le spalle e il petto senza risultare stretto. Lo uso tantissimo per andare in ufficio.</p>\n        <strong>Daniele V.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/b01ad1e243c137764b3790555238ba96.jpg?v=1795393541\" alt=\"Claudio F.\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Un capo essenziale che mancava nel mio armadio. Morbido, traspirante e con una tonalità di blu davvero intensa e raffinata.</p>\n        <strong>Claudio F.</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/20ce27e22e96f4732ff645a54b2f7865.jpg?v=1795393537\" alt=\"Riccardo De Luca\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>Ero un po' scettico sulla lunghezza delle maniche perché sono piuttosto alto, ma con la possibilità di reso ho deciso di provare. Calza a pennello, il tessuto cade benissimo ed è super confortevole anche dopo ore. Rapporto qualità-prezzo imbattibile, grazie!</p>\n        <strong>Riccardo De Luca</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/0771305224cdf6b391e8fc77642059ba.jpg?v=1795393536\" alt=\"Paolo Gallo\" loading=\"lazy\" draggable=\"false\">\n      <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-body\">\n        <span class=\"up-reviews-v2-quote\">“</span>\n        <div class=\"up-reviews-v2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>All'inizio non ero sicuro se prenderlo perché cercavo qualcosa di curato ma pratico per tutti i giorni. Alla fine mi sono fidato e ho fatto centro: cuciture ottime, zero pieghe fastidiose e un comfort assurdo. A questo prezzo non si trova di meglio. Grazie mille a Úrsula Privée!</p>\n        <strong>Paolo Gallo</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.up-reviews-v2 {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-width: 0;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-track {\n  display: flex !important;\n  flex-wrap: nowrap !important;\n  gap: 16px;\n  width: 100%;\n  overflow-x: auto !important;\n  overflow-y: hidden !important;\n  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n  overscroll-behavior-x: contain;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n  cursor: grab;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  transition: height .35s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);\n  padding: 5px 0 12px;\n  touch-action: pan-x pan-y;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-track::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-track.is-dragging {\n  cursor: grabbing;\n  scroll-snap-type: none;\n  scroll-behavior: auto;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-card {\n  display: flex !important;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  flex: 0 0 85% !important;\n  width: 85%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  min-width: 0;\n  background: #f5f2ef;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  scroll-snap-align: start;\n  scroll-snap-stop: always;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-card > img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n  height: auto;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: center;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-body {\n  position: relative;\n  padding: 24px 18px 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #39332f;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-quote {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -30px;\n  right: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 65px;\n  height: 65px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #171512;\n  color: white;\n  font-family: Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: 35px;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-stars {\n  color: #e9a000;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-body p {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  margin: 0 0 10px;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-body strong {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: .3px;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-navigation {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0 0 auto 0;\n  z-index: 2;\n  height: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-navigation button {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: var(--up-rv2-arrow-top, 130px);\n  display: flex !important;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 38px;\n  height: 38px;\n  min-width: 38px;\n  padding: 0;\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #fff;\n  color: #222;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgb(0 0 0 / .16);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  pointer-events: auto;\n  opacity: 1;\n  transition: opacity .3s ease, transform .4s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-prev {\n  left: 8px;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-next {\n  right: 8px;\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-navigation button:disabled {\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n@media (hover: hover) {\n  .up-reviews-v2-navigation button:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.08);\n  }\n}\n\n.up-reviews-v2-navigation svg {\n  width: 21px;\n  height: 21px;\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: currentColor;\n  stroke-width: 1.8;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 750px) {\n  .up-reviews-v2-card {\n    flex-basis: 340px !important;\n    width: 340px;\n  }\n\n  .up-reviews-v2-navigation button {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    min-width: 44px;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  function initReviewsV2() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-up-reviews-v2]').forEach(function (carousel) {\n      if (carousel.dataset.upReady === '1') return;\n\n      var track = carousel.querySelector('.up-reviews-v2-track');\n      var cards = Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll('.up-reviews-v2-card'));\n      var prev = carousel.querySelector('.up-reviews-v2-prev');\n      var next = carousel.querySelector('.up-reviews-v2-next');\n\n      if (!track || !prev || !next || !cards.length) return;\n\n      carousel.dataset.upReady = '1';\n\n      function getCardPosition(card) {\n        return card.getBoundingClientRect().left -\n          track.getBoundingClientRect().left +\n          track.scrollLeft;\n      }\n\n      function cardActual() {\n        var current = track.scrollLeft;\n        return cards.find(function (card) {\n          return getCardPosition(card) >= current - 8;\n        }) || cards[cards.length - 1];\n      }\n\n      function updateButtons() {\n        var max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth;\n        prev.disabled = track.scrollLeft <= 3;\n        next.disabled = max <= 3 || track.scrollLeft >= max - 3;\n      }\n\n      function syncHeight() {\n        var card = cardActual();\n        if (!card || !card.offsetHeight) return;\n\n        track.style.height = (card.offsetHeight + 17) + 'px';\n\n        var img = card.querySelector('img');\n        if (img && img.offsetHeight) {\n          carousel.style.setProperty(\n            '--up-rv2-arrow-top',\n            Math.round(img.offsetHeight / 2 - 19) + 'px'\n          );\n        }\n      }\n\n      function goToCard(card) {\n        if (!card) return;\n\n        track.scrollTo({\n          left: getCardPosition(card),\n          behavior: 'smooth'\n        });\n\n        setTimeout(syncHeight, 100);\n        setTimeout(syncHeight, 450);\n      }\n\n      next.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        var current = track.scrollLeft;\n        var target = cards.find(function (card) {\n          return getCardPosition(card) > current + 8;\n        });\n        if (target) goToCard(target);\n      });\n\n      prev.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        var current = track.scrollLeft;\n        var previous = cards.filter(function (card) {\n          return getCardPosition(card) < current - 8;\n        });\n\n        if (previous.length) {\n          goToCard(previous[previous.length - 1]);\n        }\n      });\n\n      var pending = false;\n\n      track.addEventListener('scroll', function () {\n        updateButtons();\n\n        if (pending) return;\n        pending = true;\n\n        requestAnimationFrame(function () {\n          pending = false;\n          syncHeight();\n        });\n      }, { passive: true });\n\n      var dragging = false;\n      var startX = 0;\n      var startScroll = 0;\n      var moved = false;\n\n      track.addEventListener('pointerdown', function (e) {\n        if (e.pointerType !== 'mouse' || e.button !== 0) return;\n\n        dragging = true;\n        moved = false;\n        startX = e.clientX;\n        startScroll = track.scrollLeft;\n        track.classList.add('is-dragging');\n      });\n\n      window.addEventListener('pointermove', function (e) {\n        if (!dragging) return;\n\n        var distance = e.clientX - startX;\n        if (Math.abs(distance) > 5) moved = true;\n\n        if (moved) {\n          track.scrollLeft = startScroll - distance;\n        }\n      });\n\n      window.addEventListener('pointerup', function () {\n        if (!dragging) return;\n\n        dragging = false;\n        track.classList.remove('is-dragging');\n        updateButtons();\n      });\n\n      track.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n        if (moved) {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          e.stopPropagation();\n          moved = false;\n        }\n      }, true);\n\n      function refresh() {\n        updateButtons();\n        syncHeight();\n      }\n\n      window.addEventListener('resize', refresh);\n      window.addEventListener('load', refresh);\n\n      if (window.ResizeObserver) {\n        var observer = new ResizeObserver(refresh);\n        cards.forEach(function (card) {\n          observer.observe(card);\n        });\n      }\n\n      cards.forEach(function (card) {\n        var img = card.querySelector('img');\n        if (img && !img.complete) {\n          img.addEventListener('load', refresh, { once: true });\n        }\n      });\n\n      refresh();\n    });\n  }\n\n  initReviewsV2();\n\n  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initReviewsV2);\n  }\n\n  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', initReviewsV2);\n})();\n</script>",
        "background_color": "",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "up_ugc": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Community · foto delle clienti",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- doc -%}\n  Úrsula Privée · Galeria UGC\n  Fotos originales + 7 nuevas fotografias.\n  Movimiento automatico y continuo.\n{%- enddoc -%}\n\n{%- capture ugc_data -%}\n  {%- render 'up-review-data', grupo: grupo -%}\n{%- endcapture -%}\n\n{%- assign ugc_n = ugc_data | strip | split: '~~' | size -%}\n\n{%- if ugc_n < 5 -%}\n  {%- capture ugc_data -%}\n    {%- render 'up-review-data', grupo: 'generale' -%}\n  {%- endcapture -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} Siete fotografias adicionales {%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- capture ugc_extra -%}\nhttps://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/ef2e5372d35c706898815bc266409a38.jpg?v=1795049669~~https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/9e3c48ea6d34636bd3ea3de4026d7db7.jpg?v=1795049197~~https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/fec761e1bd47404862030dce79dec8d7.jpg?v=1795049149~~https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/aiimg_4ad961840798522dcd75c3122a889a99-0.jpg?v=1795047987~~https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/hf_20260930_125308_539c226e-f7af-4343-8f54-35a560ce1ea0.png?v=1795032148~~https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/Designsanstitre-2026-03-31T175431.719.webp?v=1795032027~~https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1041/5816/7375/files/Selfi_en_salon_acogedor.png?v=1794959741\n{%- endcapture -%}\n\n{%- liquid\n  assign ugc_data = ugc_data | strip\n  assign ugc_extra = ugc_extra | strip\n  assign ugc_data = ugc_data | append: '~~' | append: ugc_extra\n  assign ugc_items = ugc_data | split: '~~'\n\n  assign ugc_t1 = 'Le nostre clienti con'\n  assign ugc_t2 = 'Úrsula Privée'\n  assign ugc_txt = 'Community' | append: ugc_t1 | append: ugc_t2\n-%}\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&text={{ ugc_txt | url_encode }}&display=swap\" media=\"print\" onload=\"this.media='all'\">\n\n<section class=\"ugc\" id=\"ugc-{{ section.id }}\" aria-labelledby=\"ugch-{{ section.id }}\">\n  <header class=\"ugc-h\">\n    <p class=\"ugc-e\">Community</p>\n    <h2 id=\"ugch-{{ section.id }}\">{{ ugc_t1 }} <em>{{ ugc_t2 }}</em></h2>\n    <span class=\"ugc-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"ugc-w\" id=\"ugcw-{{ section.id }}\" style=\"--dur:{{ ugc_items.size | times: 7 }}s\">\n    <ul class=\"ugc-l\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Foto delle nostre clienti\">\n\n      {%- for pass in (1..2) -%}\n        {%- for it in ugc_items -%}\n          {%- assign u = it | strip | split: '|' | first | strip -%}\n\n          {%- if u contains 'https://' -%}\n            <li class=\"ugc-c ugc-c--{{ forloop.index | modulo: 3 }}\"{% if pass == 2 %} aria-hidden=\"true\"{% endif %}>\n              <img\n                src=\"{{ u | escape }}\"\n                alt=\"{% if pass == 1 %}Cliente di Úrsula Privée{% endif %}\"\n                loading=\"lazy\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                width=\"800\"\n                height=\"1000\"\n                onerror=\"this.closest('.ugc-c').remove()\"\n              >\n            </li>\n          {%- endif -%}\n\n        {%- endfor -%}\n      {%- endfor -%}\n\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"ugc-b\"><strong>+6.000 clienti</strong> soddisfatte</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n.section:has(> .ugc){display:block;max-width:100%;padding-inline:0}\n\n.ugc{\n  --k:#1c1a17;\n  --m:#6f655c;\n  --f:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;\n  --gap:clamp(10px,1.2vw,16px);\n  --h:clamp(230px,30vw,420px);\n  grid-column:1/-1;\n  display:block;\n  width:100%;\n  max-width:100vw;\n  min-width:0;\n  padding:clamp(32px,5vw,64px) 0;\n  color:var(--k)\n}\n\n.ugc *{box-sizing:border-box}\n\n.ugc-h{\n  text-align:center;\n  max-width:1320px;\n  margin:0 auto clamp(20px,3vw,36px);\n  padding:0 clamp(16px,3vw,48px)\n}\n\n.ugc-h h2{\n  margin:0;\n  font:300 clamp(1.9rem,4.4vw,3.2rem)/1.1 var(--f);\n  overflow-wrap:break-word;\n  text-wrap:balance\n}\n\n.ugc-h h2 em{font-weight:300}\n\n.ugc-e{\n  margin:0 0 8px;\n  font-size:11px;\n  letter-spacing:.32em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;\n  color:var(--m)\n}\n\n.ugc-r{\n  display:block;\n  width:48px;\n  height:1px;\n  margin:14px auto 0;\n  background:var(--k);\n  opacity:.45\n}\n\n.ugc-w{\n  position:relative;\n  width:100%;\n  min-width:0;\n  overflow:hidden\n}\n\n.ugc-l{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:var(--gap);\n  width:max-content;\n  margin:0;\n  padding:0;\n  list-style:none;\n  animation:ugc-run var(--dur,49s) linear infinite;\n  animation-play-state:paused\n}\n\n.ugc-w.is-on .ugc-l{\n  animation-play-state:running;\n  will-change:transform\n}\n\n@keyframes ugc-run{\n  from{transform:translate3d(calc(-50% - var(--gap)/2),0,0)}\n  to{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}\n}\n\n.ugc-c{\n  flex:0 0 auto;\n  height:var(--h);\n  aspect-ratio:3/4;\n  border-radius:10px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  background:#efe9e1\n}\n\n.ugc-c--2{aspect-ratio:4/5}\n.ugc-c--0{aspect-ratio:1/1}\n\n.ugc-c img{\n  width:100%;\n  height:100%;\n  object-fit:cover;\n  display:block;\n  -webkit-user-drag:none;\n  user-select:none\n}\n\n.ugc-l,.ugc-c{pointer-events:none}\n\n.ugc-b{\n  position:absolute;\n  top:50%;\n  left:50%;\n  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n  z-index:2;\n  margin:0;\n  padding:clamp(12px,1.6vw,18px) clamp(18px,2.6vw,32px);\n  border-radius:999px;\n  background:#fff;\n  color:var(--k);\n  font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,19px);\n  line-height:1.2;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n  box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgb(0 0 0/.14);\n  pointer-events:none\n}\n\n.ugc-b strong{font-weight:700}\n\n@supports (mask-image:linear-gradient(#000,#000)){\n  .ugc-w{\n    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 5%,#000 95%,transparent);\n    mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 5%,#000 95%,transparent)\n  }\n}\n\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .ugc-l{animation:none}\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(()=>{\n  const w=document.getElementById('ugcw-{{ section.id }}');\n  if(!w)return;\n\n  let vis=true,inv=false,lit=false;\n\n  const sync=()=>{\n    w.classList.toggle('is-on',vis&&inv);\n  };\n\n  document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{\n    vis=!document.hidden;\n    sync();\n  });\n\n  new IntersectionObserver(es=>{\n    es.forEach(e=>{\n      inv=e.isIntersecting;\n\n      if(inv&&!lit){\n        lit=true;\n        w.querySelectorAll('img[loading=\"lazy\"]').forEach(i=>{\n          i.loading='eager';\n        });\n      }\n\n      sync();\n    });\n  },{rootMargin:'600px'}).observe(w);\n})();\n</script>",
